        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Splash: Mushrooms is a charming and relaxing puzzle game that will lift your spirits and take You into the world of cool mushrooms and art. Venture into the gallery, where you will find many extraordinary and colorful mushrooms  paintings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to skillfully move puzzle pieces, find their corresponding places, and harmoniously connect the colored details. Paying great attention to detail and applying a creative approach will help you become a true master at assembling mushrooms pictures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start gathering your collection of mushrooms pictures right now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Color Splash: Mushrooms: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•50 levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Colorful art </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Simple controls (mouse) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Achievements </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Relaxing music </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115890/extras/22ea5fbc1c950c6a88047b12b8cfbcd5.avif?t=1777112780\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p>",
